      "content": "step away from it? what does that even mean. i mean i can rest for a night but then i wake up tomorrow and i'm just back to the same person with the same problems. the cycle just resets. it's like there's no version of me that isn't broken. it feels more like i'm just waiting for the other shoe to drop every single time.",
